    "detailed_description": "My Littlest Skeleton is a cosy and relaxing simulation where you care for your very own little Skeleton chum!<br><br>Pull your unique Skeleton back from the depths of the Nether Region. Attend to their needs, maintain their crypt furnishings, and choose from a variety of environments for your Skeleton to call home.<br><br>The happier your Skeleton becomes, the greater the rewards! So make sure you take good care of them, because, after all, there is a Skeleton in all of us!<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Customise your Skeletons' Identity to make them uniquely yours!<br></li><li> Maintain your Skeletons needs by giving them the furnishings they need<br></li><li> Maintain the upkeep of your Skeleton's surroundings and environment, they are quite clumsy after all.<br></li><li> Choose from a number of environments for your Skeleton to live in!</li></ul>",
